OL,3,GNEWSACars torched in garage yard amid
OL,4,Afears of resurgence in gang feud
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetectives are keeping an open mind as
OL,7,Fto whether a deliberate fire at a
OL,8,Fgarage in Glasgow is linked to a
OL,9,Fresurgence in gangland violence.
OL,11,FPolice Scotland said the alarm was
OL,12,Fraised at about 00:40 on Causeyside
OL,13,FStreet, Tollcross.
OL,15,FOn Saturday a vehicle was torched at
OL,16,FKelvinside Motor Company in
OL,17,FKirkintilloch, days after officers
OL,18,Fattended a "disturbance" at the same
OL,19,Fproperty.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
