OL,3,GNEWSACars torched in garage yard amid
OL,4,Afears of resurgence in gang feud
OL,5,
OL,6,FThat blaze came just 24 hours after
OL,7,Fpolice confirmed they were
OL,8,Finvestigating a car crash into a house
OL,9,Fin the suburb of Eaglesham, south of
OL,10,FGlasgow.
